            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            amount: 8,
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lionel%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Lionel",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:heal_unit",
            amount: "full",
            animate: "yes",
            filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Lionel%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
            id: "Lionel",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1500,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("Ah, much better. Thanks again for the healing, old man, but I’m afraid this is the last we’ll be seeing of each other for some time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Oh? You’ve been pulled back from the front?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("Not quite. Remember Delfador’s prophecy? “Line of Kings”? “Sceptre of the Wesfolk”?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("Well, Garard’s worried. Queen’s gossip is that one of the nobles knows where the long-lost Sceptre of Fire is. I dunno if that’s true, but e’ryone knows that the king should hold the Sceptre. If a noble did get their hands on it they’d have a pretty strong claim to Garard’s throne."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("The king’s sendin’ me and an entire company of Weldyn’s most finest on a ’grand journey’ into the wildlands to find the Sceptre first, and ensure he stays firmly in power."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Good gods, why now? Wesnoth is in enough trouble as it is, without worrying about lost artifacts and suicide missions."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("You know how the king can be when he gets his mind set on somethin’. And if someone really is trying to usurp the throne... Well, I only hope I can find the Sceptre quickly, and resume my place at the king’s side."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Lionel",
            x: 15,
            y: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Lionel",
            x: 19,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Lionel",
            x: 19,
            y: 4,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Lionel",
          },
          {
            tag: "foreach",
            variable: "MODIFY_UNIT_store",
            item: "this_item",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
                variable: "this_item.facing",
                value: "sw",
                mode: "value",
              },
              {
                tag: "hook",
                name: "command:unstore_unit",
                variable: "this_item",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("Lionel! You don’t... <b><i>have</i></b> to go, you know. You’re Garard’s top general — if you refuse, I’m not sure there’s much he could do about it."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Methor",
            text: _("And it would be for the king’s own good! Garard needs you <b><i>here</i></b>, Lionel! Wesnoth needs you here."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lionel",
            text: _("I’m loyal, Methor. Always have been, always will be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 500,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scenario_move",
            unit: "Lionel",
            x: 24,
            y: 2,
          },
